# The idle pose of every battle species: the L50～55 rental list holds all 40 (4 a row, 10 rows, in the order the
# list shows them), and each rental card turns the species' 3D model in its idle animation. The route snakes through
# the list (row 0 left to right, row 1 right to left, ...), opens each card (A), takes two shots 50 frames apart (the
# idle animation is long, so compare.py picks the closest ares frame in the window) and closes it (B). Labels are
# c<nn>_r<row>c<column>: c02 is Charizard (its tail flame), c38 Moltres (its head flame), c40 Articuno.
@gb green
@window 12 100
1200 START 300 A 400 shot:main_menu
A 200 A 200 RIGHT 40
A 300 DOWN 40 A 300 A 300 100 A 200 100 A 150 shot:rental_list

A 120 shot:c01_r0c0_a 50 shot:c01_r0c0_b B 100
